# Optional. Pin a Scan / registry endpoint instead of probing candidates.
# VITE_SCAN_URL=https://api.cantonnodes.com

# Optional. Override the Cantex public API base (defaults to mainnet).
# VITE_CANTEX_URL=https://api.cantex.io/v1/public

# Optional. The network's migration id, used for Scan ACS snapshots.
# VITE_MIGRATION_ID=4

# Optional — enables WalletConnect, the only way to reach a wallet from a
# mobile browser. Free project id from https://cloud.reown.com
#
# Vite reads this file when the dev server STARTS, so restart after changing it.
# Also uncomment 'walletconnect' in src/wallets.config.ts to offer it.
# VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id

# Optional. How far to back-date a transfer's requestedAt, in seconds.
# The ledger requires requestedAt to be in the past; 60s absorbs ordinary
# clock drift. Raise it only if a machine's clock is badly out of sync.
# VITE_REQUESTED_AT_BACKDATE_SECONDS=60
